** sch_path: /foss/designs/drms-elie3/2_ideal_circuits/ideal_modulator.sch
**.subckt ideal_modulator Vdd Vin out phi1 phi2 trip Vref Vcm vss
*.ipin Vin
*.ipin phi1
*.ipin trip
*.ipin phi2
*.ipin Vcm
*.ipin Vref
*.iopin vss
S1 Vin net1 phi1 trip SW1
S2 net1 Vfb phi2 trip SW1
S3 diff net2 phi2 trip SW1
S4 net2 Vcm phi1 trip SW1
C2 diff Vint {C2} m=1
C1 net1 net2 {C1} m=1
x1 Vcm diff Vint ideal_opamp
x3 Vdd cmp Vint Vcm phi1 ideal_comparator
x4 Vfb net3 vss Vref ideal_inverter
x2 net3 net4 phi1 cmp resb VDD VSS sg13g2_dfrbp_1
Vresb resb GND dc 0 pwl(0, 0, {per/2}, 0, {per/2+100p} {vdd}
Vdd Vdd GND {Vdd}
**.ends

* expanding   symbol:  /foss/designs/drms-elie3/2_ideal_circuits/ideal_opamp.sym # of pins=3
