** sch_path: /foss/designs/drms-elie3/2_ideal_circuits/ideal_opamp.sch
.subckt ideal_opamp inp inn out
*.opin out
*.ipin inp
*.ipin inn
E1 out GND inp inn 1Meg
R1 out GND 100Meg m=1
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  /foss/designs/drms-elie3/2_ideal_circuits/ideal_comparator.sym # of pins=5
** sym_path: /foss/designs/drms-elie3/2_ideal_circuits/ideal_comparator.sym
